# Khufra, Desert Tyrant

> Khufra is not really a tank in the engage sense. He is an anti-mobility tool pretending to be a frontline, and the enemy draft decides whether he works. Against a dash-heavy carry he dismantles the game; against a poke comp he is an overpriced target dummy with slow cooldowns and nothing to do.

