## Curated builds

Reviewed against patch 2.1.67 on 2026-05-13. The live patch is 2.2.16a, so these have not been re-read against it yet.

### Roam Anti-Dash Conceal (Roam)

- Items: Tough Boots, Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Athena's Shield, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Conceal
- Flex: Rapid Boots over Tough Boots when Use when crowd control is light and Khufra needs faster bush-to-bush angles before the first Turtle fight.; Radiant Armor over Athena's Shield when Use against repeated magic poke or burn damage that chips Khufra before he can start with Tyrant's Revenge.; Guardian Helmet over Immortality when Use when your team is winning vision but Khufra enters every objective setup too low to threaten a clean wall slam.
- Total cost: 11060 gold

Default ranked Khufra setup for punishing blink-heavy drafts with hidden S1 angles, Conceal starts, and enough HP to keep Bouncing Ball active after the engage.

### Roam Frontline Encourage (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass, Radiant Armor, Immortality
- Core: Cursed Helmet, Dominance Ice, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Flicker
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when magic chip or layered crowd control matters more than repeated physical basic attacks.; Athena's Shield over Radiant Armor when Use against one-rotation magic burst that tries to delete Khufra before Bouncing Ball can reset the fight.; Guardian Helmet over Radiant Armor when Use when the enemy magic damage is low and Khufra needs out-of-combat recovery for repeated Lord setups.
- Total cost: 10810 gold

Grouped-fight setup for objective games where Khufra frontlines longer and the team benefits more from Encourage than from a hidden pickoff start.

### Roam Vengeance Anti-Physical (Roam)

- Items: Warrior Boots, Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Antique Cuirass, Oracle, Immortality
- Core: Dominance Ice, Blade Armor, Antique Cuirass
- Emblem: Tank Emblem with Vitality, Tenacity, Concussive Blast
- Battle spell: Vengeance
- Blessing: Encourage
- Flex: Tough Boots over Warrior Boots when Use when the physical carries are protected by enough control that Khufra cannot stay in ball form cleanly.; Athena's Shield over Oracle when Use when one magic burst threat is more dangerous than extended healing, regen, or passive-sustain value.; Guardian Helmet over Oracle when Use when another teammate starts fights and Khufra's job is to re-enter at full HP for the second contact.
- Total cost: 10790 gold

Anti-physical variant for drafts where another teammate can help start fights and Khufra needs Vengeance plus armor to body-block for his carry.

